5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,We must ensure our choice doesn't overburden our dear staff. Who is actually available to help us?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logistics are usually where we fail. I want to see where the actual bottlenecks occur during delivery.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm more interested in what the public actually enjoys. Let's look at the real visitor data.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The gallery is a physical space with limits. We need to check the structural and booking constraints.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know where the money goes! Why do we always have surprise bills at the end?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, that is a very practical point. We should be careful with our spending.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@May, popularity is fine, but a show that doesn't open on time is a failure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, you're so cold! But fine, let's balance the ""how"" with the ""why.""","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We can't ignore the physical reality of the suspended bay or the evening hires.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Exactly! I'll look into the costs that usually hide from us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into our volunteers and the lab staffing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll focus on the shipping cut-offs and transport costs.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I'll check the head counts and the comment slips.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will investigate the structural survey and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm going for the mount-making charges and the transport costs too!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
