34,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The lab is severely understaffed, and our volunteers are mostly town historians. We can't handle complex new prep.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,It's as I feared. Shipping delays from distant lenders have caused openings to slip. It's a huge risk.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,"Interestingly, visitors love it when people are actually working or talking in the gallery. Static cases are boring.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and evening hires mean we can't have permanent, fragile blockages.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Transport costs are eating a third of our installation budget! And bespoke mounts are getting way too expensive.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, that explains the budget stress. We must avoid expensive external loans and heavy lab work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, if we avoid distant loans, we solve both the budget leak and the shipping delays.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,But we need movement! The data shows head counts climb when there's a mechanism or a live element.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, as long as the ""movement"" isn't too heavy for the floor or in the way of caterers.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"So, something local? That would save on transport and maybe the mount costs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Local craftspeople would be wonderful. They could perhaps help with the demonstrations May wants.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"Logistically, local is the only safe bet. No shipping agents, no cut-off panics.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"I agree. A ""living"" exhibition is what the comment slips are begging for.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,Just no heavy stonework or massive installations that block the gallery's evening use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,And no fancy bespoke mounts! Let's keep it simple and cheap.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
